  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Tucked away in a quiet, family-friendly cul-de-sac, this impressive brand-new standalone home on a freehold title combines quality construction, stylish finishes and generous space in sought-after Glendowie.\r\n\r\nBuilt to a high standard with quality finishes throughout, the home has been thoughtfully designed for modern family living, offering four generous bedrooms, 2.5 beautifully finished bathrooms and an internal-access single garage.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a spacious, light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. The beautifully finished contemporary kitchen features a large island with a breakfast bar, excellent storage and quality appliances, creating an inviting hub for family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nSeamless indoor-outdoor flow extends the living space to a private deck, while a convenient guest toilet and internal-access garage complete the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, together with a stylish family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe location completes the package, with local parks, shopping and everyday amenities nearby, while the beautiful Eastern Bays beaches are within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate zoning for Glen Taylor School and Glendowie College, with Baradene College conveniently nearby.\r\n\r\nBrand new, standalone, freehold and finished to a high standard — an outstanding opportunity to secure a quality family home in Glendowie.\r\n\r\nContact me today for more information or to arrange a private viewing.",
